 the electrons must follow a longer path to reach their destination. This elongated path also acts as a buffer to contain electrons on this elongated path. This type of resistor acts as a capacitor.  Time crystals:  If a crystal elongates the path of an electron. Time is literally dialated for an electron within this path. An electron could travel for 1 hour in a crystal and from the outside of the crystal we would see it only 1 second after pressing a switch.","topics":[],"score":211920,"global_rank":264378},{"name":"sainadhx/ebiten-practice","owner":"sainadhx","html_url":"https://github.com/sainadhx/ebiten-practice","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Go","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211920,"global_rank":264385},{"name":"SleepyBrett/Subview-Controller","owner":"SleepyBrett","html_url":"https://github.com/SleepyBrett/Subview-Controller","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Objective-C","description":"A generic subview controller class that can be used to handle a subarea, modelled after UIViewController.","topics":[],"score":211918,"global_rank":264387},{"name":"see-mike-out/blog","owner":"see-mike-out","html_url":"https://github.com/see-mike-out/blog","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"thoughts and notes -- \ud83d\udcac  & \ud83d\udcd4 ","topics":[],"score":211915,"global_rank":264391},{"name":"hazel-ocean/do-you-like-cards","owner":"hazel-ocean","html_url":"https://github.com/hazel-ocean/do-you-like-cards","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Rust","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211914,"global_rank":264392},{"name":"mjelde/portfolio","owner":"mjelde","html_url":"https://github.com/mjelde/portfolio","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"This is the code for the portfolio page of SharonCodes.com","topics":[],"score":211913,"global_rank":264393},{"name":"ZaydH/homework_tex_template","owner":"ZaydH","html_url":